  "body": "Since `slotchange` bubbles and is fired on `slot` elements, it seems somewhat reasonable to add an `onslotchange` event handler. Since it's only useful inside shadow trees, it probably makes the most sense to add it to `HTMLElement` and `ShadowRoot`? Though maybe `SVGElement` as well? \r\n\r\nThoughts @whatwg/components?",
